{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39535","headline":"赠丘衙推 · 张蠙","name":"赠丘衙推","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙都高处掩柴扉，人世闻名见者稀。\n诗逸不拘凡对属，易穷皆达圣玄微。\n偶携童穉离青嶂，便被君侯换白衣。\n任醉宾筵莫深隐，绮罗丝竹胜渔矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}